{"parentUuid":"21e3a39e-96dd-41ec-a961-329b4cc337ec","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch4LbQvf2MGxPKXghKRUA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The v1.2.0 release run failed, so v1.2.0 is not released. It stopped at its first guard, \"Require a version-matched tag on main\", and nothing was built or published. The workflow requires the tagged commit to be an ancestor of `main`, and I pushed the tag before landing the promotion commit there. That was my slip, and I've added it to `tasks/lessons.md`.\n\nThe recovery leaves the tag alone, so there is no delete or re-cut. I pushed branch `v1/v120-promote` with the same commit `f1ad33b9` and opened PR #524. It has to merge with a merge commit so `f1ad33b9` becomes an ancestor of `main`. Once it's merged I'll re-run the failed job of run `43690861483` against the same tag and the same commit.\n\n#524 is in CI, which takes about 40 minutes. I'm also watching #523 (the G1.1-4 evidence), #522 (plan pointers), #519 and #514, and I'll merge each when its required checks are green at the exact head. Nothing is published, and I'll ask you before publishing the draft."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":751,"cache_read_input_tokens":237602,"output_tokens":360,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":751,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":360,"cache_read_input_tokens":237602,"cache_creation_input_tokens":751,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":751},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"reques