{"parentUuid":"3f480649-ad1e-4aaf-9403-12293e90e517","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch4NEdcHZyYgQxZKfGznE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"There's no deadlock. The only required checks on `main` are `test-matrix (22)`, `test-matrix (24)` and `linux-x86_64`, and `package` isn't one of them. Strict up-to-date merging is off. The tag ruleset also confirms `v*` tags can't be deleted or updated, which matches handling it by re-running the job and not re-cutting the tag.\n\n#525, #524 and #523 are all waiting on their required checks (3 pending each), so there is nothing to act on until the monitor fires. After that, the order is the same:\n1. Merge #525.\n2. Merge #524 with a merge commit.\n3. Re-run the failed release job.\n4. Bring `main` into #519, #514 and #523.\n\nNothing is published."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":426,"cache_read_input_tokens":263257,"output_tokens":366,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":120},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":426,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":366,"cache_read_input_tokens":263257,"cache_creation_input_tokens":426,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":426},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Ch4NEdHwT47cTPH3kHcHk","requestRef":"c04a6352-a8cc-4321-b00f-13db53fa77a9","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","attributionSkill":"loop","type":"assistant","uuid":"c77ab9b4-7fe0-4cda-a42b-c6297990460d","timestamp":"2026-11-15T08:04:38.865Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","e