{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"6473a60e-9fa2-4bd9-9d0c-35324295cf68","hash":"742cfbadfec87b67d6a294d2b4b7edefe32d6e1418905dcdf0366217b2527c45","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n\n<pasted_content id=\"2765\">\nJob 132747451587 in mikeholownych/nexus-code\nThe job failed in the Release workflow’s preflight checks, after successfully fetching main. The log ends with exit code 1 but doesn’t identify which check failed: the checks run silently, and the first one that returns nonzero stops the step.\n\nThe checks, in order, verify that:\n\nThe tagged commit is an ancestor of origin/main.\nThe tag version matches package.json.\nscripts/sync-version.mjs --check passes for the tag.\ndocs/releases/<tag>.md exists.\nSo the logs point to a release validation failure—not a Go cache issue or a compilation error. Check those four conditions for this tag; the first failing one is the cause. The checks are in release.yml.\n</pasted_content id=\"2765\">\n"}]}}
