{"parentUuid":"2c325644-85e1-42dd-a0fb-b110f98bcec3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch4PwkigShxxntaz6UXFu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#525 (the MQ-5 test fix) is merged as `d8de37d5`, so the red-`main` cause is addressed, but `main` isn't confirmed green until its CI run on that commit completes.\n\n- **#524 (the v1.2.0 promotion):** I closed and reopened it so its checks run against the fixed `main`. Its head is unchanged at `f1ad33b9`, so the tag still points at the same commit.\n- **#523, #519 and #514:** each now has `main` merged in and pushed, and their CI has restarted.\n- **Monitor:** one monitor is watching the `main` run on `d8de37d5` and #524's refreshed checks, ignoring the `package` job that belongs to the failed release run.\n\nWhen #524 is green I'll merge it with a merge commit, then re-run the failed release job, then verify the assets and install. I won't claim `main` is healthy until that `d8de37d5` run reports a conclusion. Nothing is published, and I'll ask you before publishing the draft."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":834,"cache_read_input_tokens":272238,"output_tokens":331,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":834,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":331,"cache_read_input_tokens":272238,"cache_creation_input_tokens":834,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":834},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Ch4PwkUZKjAjy43bS2cKg","requestRef":"2f872a84-e143-4bb2-80c5-a473a8742897