{"parentUuid":"5fb290b6-9366-46fe-9e3f-34b94c39d0f2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch4mDJaTU2VCicsR8KC81","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I rewrote the three user-level instruction files in place and opened PR #527 with a new repo `AGENTS.md`. Nothing is tested: I only checked the commands and paths against the repo, and I haven't measured whether agents behave better.\n\n| File | Before → after | Main changes |\n|---|---|---|\n| Repo `AGENTS.md` (PR #527, CI running) | 4.1 KB → 5.0 KB | Grew on purpose, because it now carries what an agent can't look up. |\n| `~/.claude/CLAUDE.md` | 2.6 KB → 1.7 KB | Merged the plan and lessons rules that were written twice. |\n| `~/.claude/RTK.md` | 0.96 KB → 0.5 KB | Dropped the install-verification block. |\n| `/home/mike/CLAUDE.md` | 4.2 KB → 2.6 KB | Dropped the agent table and the gstack skill list. |\n\n- **Repo `AGENTS.md`:**\n  - It now has the real commands and the one-file test command with a mandatory throwaway `HOME`, plus a checkable \"done\" criterion in place of \"always run tests\".\n  - It carries the CI and merge rules from this release, such as the required checks, merge-commit merges and stale PR merge refs.\n  - It also states the stable-promotion order (land on `main`, then tag) and the rule that failed runs are recorded unaltered.\n  - I removed `npm run lint`, which doesn't exist, the stale v1.0.0 framing, and no-op conventions. The XERJ rules are unchanged but tighter.\n- **`~/.claude/CLAUDE.md`:** the \"don't ask for hand-holding\" lines are now stated positively, and the rules themselves are unchanged.\n- **`~/.claude/RTK.md`:** it now says to rerun any odd-looking `grep`, `awk` or `sed` output through `rtk proxy`. I hit that rewrite problem this session.\n- **`/home/mike/CLAUDE.md`:** the delegation rules, pipeline, sub-project stacks and graphify rules are unchanged. The agent table and skill list are gone because the agent and skill lists already carry them.\n\nThe originals are in `~/.claude/backups/2026-11-15/`, and the three user-level edits take effect next session. Restore with `cp -p` from that folder.\n\nI left your checkout's uncommitted \"Agent skills\" block in `AGENTS.md` and the untracked `docs/agents/` alone. Those files aren't on `main`, so the PR omits that block, and you'll need to re-add it on top.\n\nThe release monitor for #526, #519 and `main` CI is still running."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1502,"cache_read_input_tokens":364032,"output_tokens":980,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":89},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1502,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":980,"cache_read_input_tokens":364032,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1502,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1502},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Ch4mDJJ688dbVPZNxUhF3","requestRef":"4ca0c426-1185-4e80-81ad-cccfae7a6c61","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","attributionSkill":"mattpocock-skills:writing-for-agents","attributionPlugin":"mattpocock-skills","type":"assistant","uuid":"4daa94b0-7663-43a6-991a-b836325fc38b","timestamp":"2026-11-15T13:06:01.371Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6473a60e-9fa2-4bd9-9d0c-35324295cf68","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/mike/nexus-code","sessionId":"6473a60e-9fa2-4bd9-9d0c-35324295cf68","version":"2.1.323","gitBranch":"main","slug":"robust-rolling-otter"}
