{"parentUuid":"4836c1cd-e364-4d4c-8f5f-c36018324548","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch4mxGAJb69o28pSPrC3e","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done: both changes are in #527 at `9511312a`, and its CI has restarted.\n\n- **`AGENTS.md`:** it's now 4.2 KB, down from 5.0 KB. The XERJ detail moved to `docs/XERJ_REFERENCE_CODING.md` behind a two-line trigger that keeps the requirement, the exemptions and the pointer.\n- **Merge and release rules:** these are now written as events (\"when merging…\", \"when cutting a stable release…\") with a \"bias to correct\" line and a final yes/no checklist.\n- **`CLAUDE.md`:** the new one-line file imports `AGENTS.md`, so Claude Code sessions in this repo load the repo rules. In a repo with both files, Nexus still loads `AGENTS.md` first, so the import line is ignored.\n\n**A gap I found, not fixed here:** Nexus doesn't expand `@file` imports in project instruction files. `getProjectRules` reads the first matching file raw, and the only `@file` handling anywhere is for `/team` task inputs. A repo with just a `CLAUDE.md` containing `@AGENTS.md` would put the literal text \"@AGENTS.md\" in Nexus's prompt. Project-rules loading isn't mentioned anywhere in the v1.2.1 plan or gap analysis, and I haven't opened an issue. Say so if you want it filed or added to the plan.\n\nThe monitor for #526, #519 and #527 is still running. I'll merge each as its required checks go green at the exact head, with #519 getting a closer read first."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":433,"cache_read_input_tokens":385375,"output_tokens":735,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":216},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":433,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":735,"cache_read_input_tokens":385375,"cache_creation_input_tokens":433,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":433},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Ch4mxFrwW1Uch4M6woDDW","requestRef":"b2b5191c-4f46-4cf2-85d9-6e27492dfa0e","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"a3376e8f-da61-4819-a14e-1cea3c218334","timestamp":"2026-11-15T13:15:42.918Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6473a60e-9fa2-4bd9-9d0c-35324295cf68","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/mike/nexus-code","sessionId":"6473a60e-9fa2-4bd9-9d0c-35324295cf68","version":"2.1.323","gitBranch":"main","slug":"robust-rolling-otter"}
