{"parentUuid":"fb70451b-dc04-409c-b6f6-1b61f16725d7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch4oyyHLqGf4oKL5fXJtd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Correction: the `AGENTS.md` PR is **#541**, not #527. #527 is a Dependabot `cf` version bump, and Dependabot PRs are exempt, so I haven't touched it. I never captured the number when I opened my PR and guessed it, then reported the wrong one for about an hour. I added the lesson to `tasks/lessons.md`. This doesn't affect the release, #519 or the other merges, because I read those PRs' real state directly.\n\n#541 is at head `9511312a`. Its code-scanning, JS/TS and CodeRabbit checks pass. The three required jobs and the two cloudflare-experiment jobs are still pending. A monitor is now watching #541. I'll merge it when its required checks are green at the exact head.\n\nThe `main` CI run on #519's merge `181c3833` is also still queued, and its monitor `bea9hqjsb` is still running."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":552,"cache_read_input_tokens":406458,"output_tokens":294,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":552,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":294,"cache_read_input_tokens":406458,"cache_creation_input_tokens":552,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":552},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Ch4oyxwFeeKwR9om6fyMJ","requestRef":"cc00cb9e-0498-400e-b821-8b3de57fa9e9","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"3a3c5f4