{"parentUuid":"cbe29710-7909-4769-a8c3-c84f90424c54","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch4rMTWn7zDVwW3VbXkeP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The two monitors you saw as running are progressing, but nothing was starting. All jobs on `main` and on #541 had been queued for over 40 minutes, with nine Dependabot CI runs in progress ahead of them. I cancelled those nine, plus two queued runs: one on each of two stale `v1/v114-…` branches, with no Dependabot runs among the queued ones. I logged it in the claims log. All of them can be re-run, and Dependabot PRs are exempt from v1 anyway. They may reappear when Dependabot rebases them, so I'll be watching for a repeat.\n\nI have a fresh monitor on the `main` run for `181c3833`, #519's merge commit. The older ones, `b2pyuk9ej` and `bfz0sijk6`, are redundant now. I'll stop them once I confirm the queue is moving. Still open: #541 (the `AGENTS.md` rewrite), the other `main` run on `85ef1f69`, and the \"is `main` green after the new test driver\" question, which this run answers."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":419,"cache_read_input_tokens":412279,"output_tokens":339,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":419,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":339,"cache_read_input_tokens":412279,"cache_creation_input_tokens":419,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":419},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Ch4rMTFQUrn4i69PJAc2i","requestRef":"a6df460c-e39b-4a08-b1bd-da282c83632