different from\"} the output they were recorded from.`;\n4107:     // Findings from a partial or now-different output do not cover this one: record findings again when it is removed.\n4108:     if (!same) this.distilledObservations.delete(key);\n4109:     return `[Nexus: you ran this same call before; findings from its output were recorded at step ${recorded.step}${recorded.id ? ` (${recorded.id})` : \"\"} and are in your memory. ${comparis\n4110:   }\n4111: \n4112:   /** Returns the observations the accepted compaction removed (none when no compaction was needed). */\n4113:   private admitContext(step: number, requestId: string): string[] {\n4114:     const contextLimit = this.contextLimit();\n4115:     const reserves = this.getContextReserves();\n4116:     const original = this.messages;\n4117:     let budget = this.scaledBudget(original, contextLimit);\n4118:     const initialTokens = budget.totalActiveTokens;\n4119:     const initiallyAdmissible = isContextAdmissible(initialTokens, contextLimit, reserves.completion, reserves.toolResponse);\n4120:     let compacted = false;\n4121:     let compactionAttempts = 0;\n4122:     const maxCompactionAttempts = 5;\n4123:     // Anti-thrashing across steps: after consecutive pressure compactions that each freed little (see\n4124:     // ExecutionTracker.compaction), compact only when the request would not fit, not on pressure alone.\n4125:     const lowYieldRun = this.durable && this.objective?.execution ? this.objective.execution.lowYieldCompactions : 0;\n4126:     const pressureCompactionAllowed = lowYieldRun < LOW_YIELD_COMPACTIONS_BEFORE_HOLD;\n4127:     const removedNow: string[] = [];\n4128:     // Anti-thrashing: only re-compact when the previous ladder pass actually shrank the\n4129:     // context. Once a pass yields no token reduction, a stronger pass would also be a no-op.\n4130:     let lastPassShrank = true;\n4131: \n4132:     // Check if we need to compact due to pressure (predictive or current).\n4133:     /