{"parentUuid":"014fd659-7c45-4151-b4bb-9f8147c0d9b7","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"93db3711-c191-4104-9d0a-da11f73c475a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RTyobhkaPtd2t7Rqu9Kxn9","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Anthropic \"2026 Agentic Coding Trends Report\" eight trends findings\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"2026 agentic coding trends report\",\"url\":\"https://resources.anthropic.com/2026-agentic-coding-trends-report\"},{\"title\":\"Anthropic’s 2026 Agentic Coding Trends Report: From Assistants to Agent Teams\",\"url\":\"https://rits.shanghai.nyu.edu/ai/anthropics-2026-agentic-coding-trends-report-from-assistants-to-agent-teams/\"},{\"title\":\"resources.anthropic.com\",\"url\":\"https://resources.anthropic.com/hubfs/2026%20Agentic%20Coding%20Trends%20Report.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"The Tessl Registry now has security scores, powered by SnykLearn more\",\"url\":\"https://tessl.io/blog/8-trends-shaping-software-engineering-in-2026-according-to-anthropics-agentic-coding-report/\"},{\"title\":\"Anthropic’s Agentic Coding Report gets the destination right, but not the distance\",\"url\":\"https://www.nagarro.com/en/blog/anthropic-agentic-coding-report-agentic-coding-maturity-gap\"},{\"title\":\"Anthropic: 8 agentic coding trends shaping software engineering in 2026\",\"url\":\"https://conffab.com/?p=10069\"},{\"title\":\"Anthropic: 8 agentic coding trends shaping software engineering in 2026\",\"url\":\"https://conffab.com/elsewhere/anthropic-8-agentic-coding-trends-shaping-software-engineering-in-2026/\"},{\"title\":\"テストもデバッグもレビューも「AIエージェントとの協働」が標準に Anthropicが示す2026年の開発トレンド:蓄積された技術的負債も解消? AIエージェントがもたらす8つの変化\",\"url\":\"https://atmarkit.itmedia.co.jp/ait/spv/2602/20/news052.html\"},{\"title\":\"DEV Community\",\"url\":\"https://dev.to/amitba/i-read-anthropics-2026-agentic-coding-trends-report-heres-what-it-actually-means-for-engineering-o6n\"},{\"title\":\"Anthropic's Eight Agentic Coding Trends Through a Codex CLI Lens: A Practitioner's Response\",\"url\":\"https://codex.danielvaughan.com/2026/04/17/anthropic-agentic-coding-trends-codex-cli-practitioners-response/\"},{\"title\":\"2026 02 23 agentic coding trends 2026\",\"url\":\"https://www.heyuan110.com/posts/ai/2026-02-23-agentic-coding-trends-2026/\"},{\"title\":\"anthropics 2026 agentic coding report maps the rise of multi agent dev teams\",\"url\":\"https://news.bitcoin.com/anthropics-2026-agentic-coding-report-maps-the-rise-of-multi-agent-dev-teams\"},{\"title\":\"agentic coding trends report anthropic\",\"url\":\"https://www.libertify.com/interactive-library/agentic-coding-trends-report-anthropic/\"},{\"title\":\"Anthropic's 2026 Agentic Coding Trends Report: What It Means for Codex CLI Practitioners\",\"url\":\"https://codex.danielvaughan.com/2026/05/11/anthropic-agentic-coding-trends-report-codex-cli-practitioner-response/\"},{\"title\":\"2026 Agentic Coding Trends Report\",\"url\":\"https://handsonai.info/resources/anthropic-coding-trends/\"},{\"title\":\"Anthropic's Latest 2026 Trend Report: The Unstoppable Programming Revolution of Humanity\",\"url\":\"https://longportapp.cn/news/275468355\"},{\"title\":\"Anthropic's Eight Agentic Coding Trends Mapped to Codex CLI: A Practitioner's Configuration Guide\",\"url\":\"https://codex.danielvaughan.com/2026/06/11/anthropic-eight-agentic-coding-trends-mapped-codex-cli-practitioner-configuration-guide/\"},{\"title\":\"agentic coding trends\",\"url\":\"https://www.danilchenko.dev/posts/agentic-coding-trends/\"},{\"title\":\"How AI Agents Will Redefine Software Development by 2026: 8 Trends and a Practical Playbook\",\"url\":\"https://besthub.dev/articles/how-ai-agents-will-redefine-software-development-by-2026-8-trends-and-a-practical-playbook-029b9f93bbc8\"}]\n\nThe search confirmed the report's structure and some of its trends, but not the full list of eight.\n\n- **Structure:** The report's predictions fall into three categories: foundation trends that we believe will reshape how development work happens, capability trends that look to expand what agents can do, and impact trends. Several summaries describe the same three-part grouping.\n- **Trends found:** The official PDF's table of contents lists Trend 1 on the software development lifecycle, Trend 5 on agentic coding reaching new surfaces and users, Trend 6 on productivity gains reshaping development economics, and Trend 7 on non-technical use cases. I did not find text for Trends 2, 3, 4, or 8.\n- **Recurring themes:** Summaries of the report emphasize multi-agent coordination, human oversight, extending agentic coding beyond engineering teams, and security. One source says the report closes with four priorities for organizations planning their 2026 roadmap.\n- **Publication date:** Sources disagree. A Japanese outlet says Anthropic published the report on January 21, 2026 (US time), while other summaries date it to February, March, or later.\n\nFor the complete list of eight trends, the primary source is the official report at resources.anthropic.com/2026-agentic-coding-trends-report, or the PDF at resources.anthropic.com/hubfs/2026%20Agentic%20Coding%20Trends%20Report.pdf. A follow-up search for the Trend 2–4 and Trend 8 headings would fill the gap.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"7e3c9372-038e-44cc-8197-5b50ee7a62c3","timestamp":"2026-11-15T14:23:23.405Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"Anthropic \"2026 Agentic Coding Trends Report\" eight trends findings","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01CrJ4tE7suUzekQhiSLgE9L","content":[{"title":"2026 agentic coding trends report","url":"https://resources.anthropic.com/2026-agentic-coding-trends-report"},{"title":"Anthropic’s 2026 Agentic Coding Trends Report: From Assistants to Agent Teams","url":"https://rits.shanghai.nyu.edu/ai/anthropics-2026-agentic-coding-trends-report-from-assistants-to-agent-teams/"},{"title":"resources.anthropic.com","url":"https://resources.anthropic.com/hubfs/2026%20Agentic%20Coding%20Trends%20Report.pdf"},{"title":"The Tessl Registry now has security scores, powered by SnykLearn more","url":"https://tessl.io/blog/8-trends-shaping-software-engineering-in-2026-according-to-anthropics-agentic-coding-report/"},{"title":"Anthropic’s Agentic Coding Report gets the destination right, but not the distance","url":"https://www.nagarro.com/en/blog/anthropic-agentic-coding-report-agentic-coding-maturity-gap"},{"title":"Anthropic: 8 agentic coding trends shaping software engineering in 2026","url":"https://conffab.com/?p=10069"},{"title":"Anthropic: 8 agentic coding trends shaping software engineering in 2026","url":"https://conffab.com/elsewhere/anthropic-8-agentic-coding-trends-shaping-software-engineering-in-2026/"},{"title":"テストもデバッグもレビューも「AIエージェントとの協働」が標準に Anthropicが示す2026年の開発トレンド:蓄積された技術的負債も解消? AIエージェントがもたらす8つの変化","url":"https://atmarkit.itmedia.co.jp/ait/spv/2602/20/news052.html"},{"title":"DEV Community","url":"https://dev.to/amitba/i-read-anthropics-2026-agentic-coding-trends-report-heres-what-it-actually-means-for-engineering-o6n"},{"title":"Anthropic's Eight Agentic Coding Trends Through a Codex CLI Lens: A Practitioner's Response","url":"https://codex.danielvaughan.com/2026/04/17/anthropic-agentic-coding-trends-codex-cli-practitioners-response/"},{"title":"2026 02 23 agentic coding trends 2026","url":"https://www.heyuan110.com/posts/ai/2026-02-23-agentic-coding-trends-2026/"},{"title":"anthropics 2026 agentic coding report maps the rise of multi agent dev teams","url":"https://news.bitcoin.com/anthropics-2026-agentic-coding-report-maps-the-rise-of-multi-agent-dev-teams"},{"title":"agentic coding trends report anthropic","url":"https://www.libertify.com/interactive-library/agentic-coding-trends-report-anthropic/"},{"title":"Anthropic's 2026 Agentic Coding Trends Report: What It Means for Codex CLI Practitioners","url":"https://codex.danielvaughan.com/2026/05/11/anthropic-agentic-coding-trends-report-codex-cli-practitioner-response/"},{"title":"2026 Agentic Coding Trends Report","url":"https://handsonai.info/resources/anthropic-coding-trends/"},{"title":"Anthropic's Latest 2026 Trend Report: The Unstoppable Programming Revolution of Humanity","url":"https://longportapp.cn/news/275468355"},{"title":"Anthropic's Eight Agentic Coding Trends Mapped to Codex CLI: A Practitioner's Configuration Guide","url":"https://codex.danielvaughan.com/2026/06/11/anthropic-eight-agentic-coding-trends-mapped-codex-cli-practitioner-configuration-guide/"},{"title":"agentic coding trends","url":"https://www.danilchenko.dev/posts/agentic-coding-trends/"},{"title":"How AI Agents Will Redefine Software Development by 2026: 8 Trends and a Practical Playbook","url":"https://besthub.dev/articles/how-ai-agents-will-redefine-software-development-by-2026-8-trends-and-a-practical-playbook-029b9f93bbc8"}]},"The search confirmed the report's structure and some of its trends, but not the full list of eight.\n\n- **Structure:** The report's predictions fall into three categories: foundation trends that we believe will reshape how development work happens, capability trends that look to expand what agents can do, and impact trends. Several summaries describe the same three-part grouping.\n- **Trends found:** The official PDF's table of contents lists Trend 1 on the software development lifecycle, Trend 5 on agentic coding reaching new surfaces and users, Trend 6 on productivity gains reshaping development economics, and Trend 7 on non-technical use cases. I did not find text for Trends 2, 3, 4, or 8.\n- **Recurring themes:** Summaries of the report emphasize multi-agent coordination, human oversight, extending agentic coding beyond engineering teams, and security. One source says the report closes with four priorities for organizations planning their 2026 roadmap.\n- **Publication date:** Sources disagree. A Japanese outlet says Anthropic published the report on January 21, 2026 (US time), while other summaries date it to February, March, or later.\n\nFor the complete list of eight trends, the primary source is the official report at resources.anthropic.com/2026-agentic-coding-trends-report, or the PDF at resources.anthropic.com/hubfs/2026%20Agentic%20Coding%20Trends%20Report.pdf. A follow-up search for the Trend 2–4 and Trend 8 headings would fill the gap."],"durationSeconds":6.26651229801774,"searchCount":1},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"014fd659-7c45-4151-b4bb-9f8147c0d9b7","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"6473a60e-9fa2-4bd9-9d0c-35324295cf68","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/mike/nexus-code","sessionId":"6473a60e-9fa2-4bd9-9d0c-35324295cf68","version":"2.1.323","gitBranch":"main","slug":"robust-rolling-otter"}
