{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"6473a60e-9fa2-4bd9-9d0c-35324295cf68","hash":"f550dac174706ecc81a49367b3b530bf5ec51a14d3181435ff11b7895cf54014","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0121PJourzNeTZRUg56c3ncg","type":"tool_result","content":"docs/v1.2.1/PLAN.md:179:Phase 0 (immediately after v1.2.0 ships): MQ-0, DH-1, DH-2, DH-5, PC-2, PC-1. These cut the cycle time, remove the hang class and finish the evidence.\ndocs/v1.2.1/PLAN.md:181:Phase 1 (independent, parallelisable): MQ-3, MQ-5, MQ-6, MQ-1, then MQ-2 (needs MQ-5/MQ-6 to be called certifying); PR-1, PR-2, PR-3, PR-9, PR-11; CS-3, CS-4, WM-1, WM-2, CX-1, CX-5, VC-\ndocs/v1.2.1/PLAN.md:183:Phase 2: PR-4, PR-5, PR-12; CS-7, CS-8 (D5); MQ-7 slices B and C; CS-1 and CS-2 (defaults per D1 and D2: CS-1 stays opt-in unless the default is changed by a later decision); CX-2, CX-3,\ndocs/v1.2.1/PLAN.md:185:Phase 3 (v1.2.2): native protocols PR-6 (Gemini), PR-7 (Bedrock), PR-8 (Vertex), PR-10; CS-9, CS-10, VC-8, RD-7 (added 2026-11-15 from the old-backlog review); MQ-7 slices D, E, F, G; RD\ndocs/v1.2.1/PLAN.md:195:| D1 | Containment default-on when bubblewrap is available (CS-1) | default accepted: stays opt-in |\ndocs/v1.2.1/PLAN.md:201:| D7 | CERI F02/F06 and audit Slices B–G | **include** (MQ-5, MQ-6, MQ-7); B and C in v1.2.1, D–G in v1.2.2 |\ndocs/v1.2.1/PLAN.md:220:| Network-isolated sandbox for generated code | SUPERSEDED (partly) | `eval/isolate.mjs:555,587,723` unshare the network; whether the default client sandbox path does is to be checked un\ndocs/v1.2.1/PLAN.md:228:| cgroup containment (REQ:260) | no code; bubblewrap (CS-1) is the chosen mechanism; cgroups need a privileged dependency (evaluator cgroup limits from v1.1.4 A9 are a separate, existing\ndocs/v1.2.1/PLAN.md:238:| CTX-001 provenance graph (REQ:252) | CX-1 (partial) | **decided 2026-11-15: partial coverage accepted;** a per-item graph is not planned |\ndocs/v1.2.1/PLAN.md:246:| RPC worker isolation (REQ:266) | CS-10 | **decided 2026-11-15: v1.2.2, designed with CS-1** |\ndocs/v1.2.1/PLAN.md:249:| `git.publish` PR publication (DEC-V11-12; explicitly refused at `operation_cli.ts:74`) | none | **decided 2026-11-15: keep the explicit refusal;** revisit after CS-8 and CS-1, as a can\ndocs/v1.2.1/GAP_ANALYSIS.md:108:| GA-03 | rc.1 live-gateway tool-call measurement promised and absent | ledger U row | P0 (v1.2.0) | MQ-0 |\n---\n107: | CX-6 | Prompt caching: request cache hints for providers that support them; measure cach\n108: | CX-7 | Project instruction files: expand `@path` imports in `AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md`, `C\n109: \n110: Not planned in the CX group: telling the model its remaining token budget (Anthropic conte\n111: \n112: ### PR: providers (decision D9: every cloud provider configurable)\nShell cwd was reset to /home/mike/nexus-code","is_error":false}]}}
