{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"6473a60e-9fa2-4bd9-9d0c-35324295cf68","id":"44a0e889-0259-4da4-b5d6-bf60cffe974c","timestamp":"2026-11-15T14:33:04.575Z","version":"2.1.323","querySource":"repl_main_thread","shapeHash":"02245c82d4cb86350db44b7c9960d5f359fa3c3746ce766c103fc6f328b1a703","params":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"medium"}},"base":"2db030aa-096b-45ad-9197-e86f155b7831","keep":856,"tail":["f5a53bb2eb94eeaafa7037fdceb5391cfd771973888d5ae9503ead5cea80aade","d41ccb38fc989ba6686a81832b4eb38b944549aad7d471fb603ed177813ad024"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",857,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"bd068d6c354162705ed43dac4bf5bd19be2fc6dd0b1ff45e36a40d83b5abab1c"}
{"parentUuid":"0d7c65f9-c4b9-4fc0-ad0e-56835b9b0525","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch4srqMraeXW7Y8tcc2YK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The lessons are now in the plans, as an update to PR #542 at `c4a6b039`. The PR's title and description now say so. It is docs only, and the drift check passes. Most lessons already had a home in the plan, so I sharpened existing rows and added only four small units. The new units are all P2, and none are merged yet.\n\n**v1.2.1 plan: existing rows sharpened**\n- **CX-2:** the compaction record must now name the covered event ids and where the summary is inserted, so it can be audited and undone (the OpenHands `Condensation` event pattern).\n- **CX-4:** masking tool output can't remove evidence. The independent reviewer's package comes from requirements, scope, diff and verifier receipts, not conversation context, so I added an acceptance check that it is identical before and after masking.\n- **VC-3 (reference-based verification):** I added the report's Rakuten finding that a long run stays autonomous when a reference exists. I did not raise its priority; I recorded that as an owner decision.\n\n**v1.2.1 plan: new units**\n- **CX-7:** `@path` import expansion in project instruction files, which `getProjectRules` doesn't do today (CX-6 plus a note: no remaining-token-budget notice, with the reasoning).\n- **CS-11:** audit our loop guards against OpenHands' stuck patterns, namely ping-pong alternation and consecutive no-progress messages.\n- **VC-9:** audit headless runs so every path that needs an operator decision ends with one resumable `needs_input` outcome.\n- **MQ-8:** a long-horizon run with a mid-run resume, plus paired on/off runs of instruction files and tool-output clearing with intervals. It targets v1.2.2 and needs MQ-1 and MQ-2 first.\n\n**Housekeeping and v1.3**\n- **Bookkeeping:** gaps GA-37 to GA-40 are added, phases updated, and the \"evidence still missing\" section no longer says OpenHands was unassessed (read at documentation level only) and now lists the unmeasured claims.\n- **v1.3:** AC-1 notes that hosts like OpenHands' Agent Canvas drive agents over ACP, HK-2 says skills load on a declared trigger, and an evidence note ties VR-1, VR-2 and PA-1 to the report.\n\n**Capacity:** four more units in a plan that already warns it can't all be one release. Anything not merged green slips under D12.\n\nNot planned, on purpose: telling the model its remaining token budget.\n\nI haven't rechecked CI since the last check, and I haven't merged anything in this step."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1633,"cache_read_input_tokens":498136,"output_tokens":864,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1633,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":864,"cache_read_input_tokens":498136,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1633,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1633},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Ch4srq4FZTjdCxAhzpNUj","requestRef":"44a0e889-0259-4da4-b5d6-bf60cffe974c","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"2d6a19c5-2a6c-409a-96b8-2f5fa2875c05","timestamp":"2026-11-15T14:33:10.540Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6473a60e-9fa2-4bd9-9d0c-35324295cf68","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/mike/nexus-code","sessionId":"6473a60e-9fa2-4bd9-9d0c-35324295cf68","version":"2.1.323","gitBranch":"main","slug":"