{"parentUuid":"c2e52526-7ae5-4d31-a433-61799ab12a8c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch4uRJ8w4MEfTmkcNJ5AT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#541 is merged as `d9f1278f`: `AGENTS.md` rewritten, a one-line `CLAUDE.md` that imports it, and the on-demand XERJ doc.\n\n**`main` status**\n- **Green:** `181c3833`, `85ef1f69` and `1d06e983` all completed with success, on both Node versions.\n- **Pending:** the CI run on `d9f1278f` (this docs-only merge) hasn't started, so I'm not calling it green.\n- **#542:** the plans PR still has its three required checks pending. I'll merge it at its exact head once they pass, after confirming the run on `d9f1278f`, since both are docs-only and independent.\n\nThe v1.2.0 stable release has been published and verified throughout. The remaining open work is the v1.2.1 plan itself, which is now in #542, and the Dependabot PRs, which I'm leaving alone."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":455,"cache_read_input_tokens":504297,"output_tokens":295,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":455,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":295,"cache_read_input_tokens":504297,"cache_creation_input_tokens":455,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":455},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Ch4uRHmc2FR2Fd8dQcnJW","requestRef":"3cf507ab-f86f-40cd-96e5-ebdeaf9635be","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"b067dee6-e8d5-469e-b061-f4a85b17f881","timestamp