{"parentUuid":"ae8649d7-58ae-4f13-a8bb-f5e52b42756e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch4uSx7j7XsyGNwSzeRp2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The hook is right, and I won't claim otherwise. v1.2.0 is published and verified, but \"frontier quality\" is not shown.\n\n- **G1.1-4 is not met on this build.** `lead-reasoning` scored 195/200 against the 99.5% bar. You chose to accept and record that, and I recorded it unaltered.\n- **No external qualification exists.** The release notes say so and make no frontier-grade claim. The plan's E0–E3 levels have not been reached.\n- **Nothing more on v1.2.0 can change this.** The tag is immutable. Re-running until the matrix passes is what you declined.\n\nWhat would move it toward that bar is in the v1.2.1 plan:\n- the benchmark adapter and the false-completion metric (MQ-1 and MQ-2), which measure claimed-done-but-wrong against ground truth;\n- the evidence units;\n- eventually an external qualification.\n\nTwo options, your call:\n1. Treat the goal as \"v1.2.0 released, qualification pending\", clear the hook, and start v1.2.1 Phase 0. I recommend this.\n2. Run the G1.1-4 matrix once on the published v1.2.0 archive and record whatever it shows. That is a measurement and not a rerun-until-pass, but it goes against your earlier call, so I'm not doing it without your word.\n\nOpen work: #542 (the plans PR) is still on its required checks. I'll merge it once they pass and the `main` run on `d9f1278f` is green."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":188,"cache_read_input_tokens":505047,"output_tokens":1497,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1008},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":188,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","itera