t":"cli","cwd":"/home/mike/nexus-code","sessionId":"6473a60e-9fa2-4bd9-9d0c-35324295cf68","version":"2.1.323","gitBranch":"main","slug":"robust-rolling-otter"}
{"parentUuid":"fa3ef4ee-ab3c-4c0c-b3b6-4b9d1262e6f0","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"e64ba8fb-fe68-4897-afe4-2104ab953a6d","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012qwo6jy1jhT8PyCMfGBCUJ","type":"tool_result","content":"## Models\n\n**Current and recommended:** `jev-1.14.0`, the newest Jev release, available from October 14, 2026. It supports all question types, including Box.\n\n**Other versioned model:** `jev-1.13.0`. It doesn't support Box questions.\n\n**Aliases:**\n- `jev-latest` points to `jev-1.14.0` and is the default in the client SDKs.\n- `jev-preview` also points to `jev-1.14.0`. No preview build is available right now.\n\n## Context Limits\n\nBoth models have the same limits:\n- **Per-request:** 64k tokens for the `state` plus all questions combined.\n- **Per-question:** 32k tokens for the `state` plus any one question.\n\nFor up to 262k tokens in both limits, send the `TypeSafe-Danger-Zone-Long-Context: true` header on each request that needs it. Long context costs the same per token, but it is slower and less accurate, so use it only when needed.\n\n## Rate Limits\n\n- Limits are set per organization and measured in tokens per second and requests per second.\n- Requests over a limit return `429 Too Many Requests`. The client SDKs retry these by default.\n- Your current limits are in the developer console. Higher limits are available on custom and enterprise plans through a request form.\n\n## Pricing\n\n- $42 per Btok ($0.042 per Mtok) for both models.\n- You pay only for input tokens. Output tokens are free."}]},"uuid":"e8634c6c-09c1-4820-abd5-0e569f7b6e7a","timestamp":"2026-11-15T15:10:10.578Z","toolUseResult":{"bytes":8177,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"## Models\n\n**Current and recommended:** `jev-1.14.0`, the newest Jev release, available from October 14, 2026. It supports all question types, including Box.\n\n**Other versioned model:** `jev-1.13.0`. It doesn't support Box questions.\n\n**Aliases:**\n- `jev-latest` points to `jev-1.14.0` and is the default in the client SDKs.\n- `jev-preview` also points to `jev-1.14.0`. No preview build is available right now.\n\n## Context Limits\n\nBoth models have the same limits:\n- **Per-request:** 64k tokens for the `state` plus all questions combined.\n- **Per-question:** 32k tokens for the `state` plus any one question.\n\nFor up to 262k tokens in both limits, send the `TypeSafe-Danger-Zone-Long-Context: true` header on each request that needs it. Long context costs the same per token, but it is slower and less accurate, so use it only when needed.\n\n## Rate Limits\n\n- Limits are set per organization and measured in tokens per second and requests per second.\n- Requests over a limit return `429 Too Many Requests`. The client SDKs retry these by default.\n- Your current limits are in the developer console. Higher limits are available on custom and enterprise plans through a request form.\n\n## Pricing\n\n- $42 per Btok ($0.042 per Mtok) for both models.\n- You pay only for input tokens. Output tokens are free.","durationMs":5496,"url":"https://docs.typesafe.ai/go/models.md"},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"fa3ef4ee-ab3c-4c0c-b3b6-4b9d1262e6f0","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"6473a60e-9fa2-4bd9-9d0c-35324295cf68","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/mike/nexus-code","sessionId":"6473a60e-9fa2-4bd9-9d0c-35324295cf68","version":"2.1.323","gitBranch":"main","slug":"robust-rolling-otter"}
