{"parentUuid":"ac33a89f-b9fe-40a7-91db-2892bbc642db","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"e64ba8fb-fe68-4897-afe4-2104ab953a6d","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BnBqL5jxtdKFAxTMsQQvww","type":"tool_result","content":"**Base URL:** `https://api.typesafe.ai`\n**Endpoint:** `POST /v1/systemone`\n\n**Auth header:** `Authorization: Bearer <API_KEY>`\n\n**Request body (JSON):**\n- `model` (string, required): Model name or alias. Get available names from `GET /v1/models`. Example: `\"jev-latest\"`.\n- `state` (required): A string, object, or array. This is the content all questions refer to.\n- `questions` (object, required, at least 1): Each key is a name you choose. Each value is a question object.\n- `assets` (object, optional): Image assets keyed by placeholder. Requires the `TypeSafe-Danger-Zone-Images: true` header.\n\n**Noul question shape:**\n- `type`: `\"noul\"` (required)\n- `instructions` (optional): The yes/no question or statement. Can be a string, object, array, or null.\n- `criteria` (optional): An object with optional `\"true\"` and `\"false\"` keys. Each describes what counts as a yes or no. Values can be a string, object, array, or null.\n\n**Options:**\n- Header `TypeSafe-Danger-Zone-Images: true`: needed for `assets` or `box` questions.\n- Header `TypeSafe-Danger-Zone-Long-Context: true`: enables long context.\n- Alternative body: `multipart/form-data`, with the JSON as a `request` part (`application/json`) followed by one image part per asset.\n\n**Noul response shape (200):**\n```json\n{\n  \"model\": \"jev-latest\",\n  \"answers\": {\n    \"billing\": {\n      \"type\": \"noul\",\n      \"noul\": 0.98\n    }\n  },\n  \"usage\": {\n    \"input_tokens\": 120,\n    \"output_tokens\": 12\n  }\n}\n```\n`noul` is the probability of yes or true, from 0 to 1.\n\n**Errors:**\n- `400`: `{\"detail\": \"<string or object>\"}`\n- `422`: `{\"detail\": [{\"loc\": [...], \"msg\": \"...\", \"type\": \"...\", \"input\"?: \"...\", \"ctx\"?: {...}}]}`\n\n**Rate and size limits:** The page does not state any rate limits or request size limits. It does give these structural limits:\n- `questions` and `assets`: at least 1 entry each.\n- `choice` criteria: 1 to 255 entries.\n- `score` criteria: 1 to 10 items.\n\n**Curl example:** The page does not include a curl example, so I can't quote one verbatim. This one is built from the noul request example on the page:\n\n```bash\ncurl -X POST https://api.typesafe.ai/v1/systemone \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TYPESAFE_API_KEY\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"model\": \"jev-latest\",\n    \"state\": \"I was charged twice for my subscription this month. Please refund the extra charge.\",\n    \"questions\": {\n      \"billing\": {\n        \"type\": \"noul\",\n        \"instructions\": \"Is this message about billing?\"\n      }\n    }\n  }'\n```"}]},"uuid":"86fd57af-9d71-456b-90c0-84f9aec375c5","timestamp":"2026-11-15T15:10:12.956Z","toolUseResult":{"bytes":29761,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"**Base URL:** `https://api.typesafe.ai`\n**Endpoint:** `POST /v1/systemone`\n\n**Auth header:** `Authorization: Bearer <API_KEY>`\n\n**Request body (JSON):**\n- `model` (string, required): Model name or alias. Get available names from `GET /v1/models`. Example: `\"jev-latest\"`.\n- `state` (required): A string, object, or array. This is the content all questions refer to.\n- `questions` (object, required, at least 1): Each key is a name you choose. Each value is a question object.\n- `assets` (object, optional): Image assets keyed by placeholder. Requires the `TypeSafe-Danger-Zone-Images: true` header.\n\n**Noul question shape:**\n- `type`: `\"noul\"` (required)\n- `instructions` (optional): The yes/no question or statement. Can be a string, object, array, or null.\n- `criteria` (optional): An object with optional `\"true\"` and `\"false\"` keys. Each describes what counts as a yes or no. Values can be a string, object, array, or null.\n\n**Options:**\n- Header `TypeSafe-Danger-Zone-Images: true`: needed for `assets` or `box` questions.\n- Header `TypeSafe-Danger-Zone-Long-Context: true`: enables long context.\n- Alternative body: `multipart/form-data`, with the JSON as a `request` part (`application/json`) followed by one image part per asset.\n\n**Noul response shape (200):**\n```json\n{\n  \"model\": \"jev-latest\",\n  \"answers\": {\n    \"billing\": {\n      \"type\": \"noul\",\n      \"noul\": 0.98\n    }\n  },\n  \"usage\": {\n    \"input_tokens\": 120,\n    \"output_tokens\": 12\n  }\n}\n```\n`noul` is the probability of yes or true, from 0 to 1.\n\n**Errors:**\n- `400`: `{\"detail\": \"<string or object>\"}`\n- `422`: `{\"detail\": [{\"loc\": [...], \"msg\": \"...\", \"type\": \"...\", \"input\"?: \"...\", \"ctx\"?: {...}}]}`\n\n**Rate and size limits:** The page does not state any rate limits or request size limits. It does give these structural limits:\n- `questions` and `assets`: at least 1 entry each.\n- `choice` criteria: 1 to 255 entries.\n- `score` criteria: 1 to 10 items.\n\n**Curl example:** The page does not include a curl example, so I can't quote one verbatim. This one is built from the noul request example on the page:\n\n```bash\ncurl -X POST https://api.typesafe.ai/v1/systemone \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TYPESAFE_API_KEY\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"model\": \"jev-latest\",\n    \"state\": \"I was charged twice for my subscription this month. Please refund the extra charge.\",\n    \"questions\": {\n      \"billing\": {\n        \"type\": \"noul\",\n        \"instructions\": \"Is this message about billing?\"\n      }\n    }\n  }'\n```","durationMs":8564,"url":"https://docs.typesafe.ai/go/api.md"},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"ac33a89f-b9fe-40a7-91db-2892bbc642db","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"6473a60e-9fa2-4bd9-9d0c-35324295cf68","userType":"external","entrypoi