{"parentUuid":"e101fb82-aaaa-4318-b1a8-7bf1f6aca35d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch4vmwknYP5Qdx7Paf9ar","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The first request parsed correctly: HTTP 200, about 15 seconds, `finish=stop`, all nine answers returned. At that pace the remaining 25 take about 7 more minutes. I'm leaving the run alone, and I'll be notified when it completes.\n\nStatus of what you approved:\n- **Labels as written:** recorded as approved. The one disputed row (#26) stays flagged and is reported separately. I'll note that in the results.\n- **Gateway arm:** running under the GATEWAY claim, synthetic text only, with the key in the environment only. When it finishes I'll read the claim log to confirm it was released.\n- **TypeSafe arm:** blocked on the key. `TYPESAFE_API_KEY` isn't set in this environment, and I won't look for it in other files. The 26 payloads are already written, and a dry run sent nothing. Either export the key in this session's environment or tell me where you want it read from, and I'll run the live arm. The expected cost is negligible: input-only pricing at $0.042 per million tokens, pinned to model `jev-1.14.0`.\n- **Not started:** implementation. This is evaluation only, as the proposal said.\n\nWhen the gateway run finishes I'll score all arms and report the numbers with intervals and the per-message disagreements."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":647,"cache_read_input_tokens":564081,"output_tokens":421,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":647,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":421,"cache_read_input_tokens":564081,"cache_creation_input_toke