{"parentUuid":"64a74c04-5807-4687-8928-fdeeaa408c10","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch4yjRmHRWTe2mi4vCM56","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#542 is merged as `03bf579b`. All eight checks were pass at its exact head `c4a6b039`, including the re-run of the flaky Node 24 job, and the previous `main` run (`d9f1278f`) was green first. The v1.2.1 and v1.3 plans now carry CX-5's acceptance, the four new units (CX-7, CS-11, VC-9, MQ-8) and the research lessons. This was a docs-only merge, so I expect `main` to stay green, but the CI run on `03bf579b` hasn't completed and I'm not calling it green yet.\n\nI noticed one more flaky test to fix later: the `eval_integrity` scanner test failed on one run with a SIGTERM during enumeration on a loaded runner, then passed on the re-run. It isn't in the plan yet. It could go in as a process unit if you want that.\n\nNothing is in flight now except that `main` run. The open decisions are yours:\n- clear the goal or re-measure G1.1-4 on the published v1.2.0 archive;\n- commit the steering-judgment dataset, questions and scorer under `eval/`.\n\nUntil you decide, I won't start anything new."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":719,"cache_read_input_tokens":598685,"output_tokens":383,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":719,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":383,"cache_read_input_tokens":598685,"cache_creation_input_tokens":719,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":719},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBl