{"parentUuid":"eebc2b8d-6a89-4f44-8165-6e0561d89de2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch596f96GcG555RCjvNkw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Three PRs are green and ready: #544, #545 and #546, with #547 one job from done. The only thing holding the merges is the `main` run on `72830bd9`, which is still in progress. I won't merge ahead of it, since that is how `main` broke earlier.\n\nWhere things stand:\n- **G1.1-4 on the published archive:** 155/200 for `lead-reasoning` and 200/200 for `deep`. It's recorded unaltered in PR #548, with the receipts hash and a 10-call probe. The public release body now states both measurements, and the tag is unchanged.\n- **The cause:** `lead-reasoning` now writes the plain `read_file` call as text (`read_file(path=\"README.md\")`), 10 of 10 times, where it returned native calls earlier the same day. The client only recognises JSON text as a \"call written as text\", so its safe retry never engaged. I verified that in the source.\n- **The fix:** unit WM-4 (P1) is planned in #548, and an agent is implementing it. Recognition only, never execution.\n\nI'll merge in this order, each waiting on a green `main` run: #544, #545, #546, #547, then #548 once its conflict with #544 is resolved."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":859,"cache_read_input_tokens":704070,"output_tokens":393,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":859,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":393,"cache_read_input_tokens":704070,"cache_creation_input_tokens":859,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":859},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fall