{"parentUuid":"559eb140-1801-4f26-a956-59d32e931736","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch5ABaoeiA5KNMk9j3XZg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Four PRs are merged this round, plus three more updated and in CI.\n\n**Merged, each at its exact head after verification**\n- **#543:** the steering-judgment research record, `72830bd9`.\n- **#544:** the plan additions, `8340931b` (VC-10 gated steering judge, PC-7 flaky scanner test, and the CX-5 wording correction).\n- **#545:** WM-2, edit-failure feedback, `3576785f`.\n- **#546:** CX-5, the compaction invariant, with `compaction-03` now active, `2382b534`. `main` is now `2382b534`.\n\n**Merge rule I applied:** for #544–#546, I computed from git that none of their files changed on `main` since their tested base, and that they were disjoint from each other. I'll serialize only PRs that actually overlap, which is how I treated #547.\n\n**In flight**\n- **#547 (VC-5):** merged with `main` cleanly. On that merged tree, 100 of 100 tests pass on Node 22 and 24, and the type-check is clean. It is pushed, and its CI is re-running on the real combination.\n- **#548:** the stable-archive evidence plus WM-4 planning. Its gap-register conflict with #544 is resolved, keeping GA-41 through GA-43, and its CI is running.\n- **#549 (WM-4):** the function-call-text recognizer. I reviewed it: a depth-capped parser, literals only, and an early exit on non-offered names. The tests were red first, 4 of 7 failing against `main`, and pass 20 of 20 on both Node versions. It is in CI.\n\nOne watch covers #547–#549 and the `main` run on `2382b534`. I haven't claimed `main` healthy since the last green run. Caution on the watch: it may report #547 early from its old head's checks, so I'll verify its head and tested merge commit before merging."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1198,"cache_read_input_tokens":719768,"output_tokens":832,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":214},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1198,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":832,"cache_read_input_tokens":719768,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1198,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1198},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Ch5ABaVYhYsEkALRoKMVb","requestRef":"6c5776e4-bc64-4ef0-a25f-bdd69915f0f3","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"e3bca714-903f-4af9-8db5-27ccd9ee335d","timestamp":"2026-11-15T18:07:14.704Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6473a60e-9fa2-4bd9-9d0c-35324295cf68","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/mike/nexus-code","sessionId":"6473a60e-9fa2-4bd9-9d0c-35324295cf68","version":"2.1.323","gitBranch":"main","slug":"robust-rolling-otter"}
