{"parentUuid":"a750802c-3398-436f-970a-1baf08ed8c98","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch5GGCzKcEz7JFPs1BS2H","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"`main` CI on the final commit `011bb6b3` finished completed/success, with `test-matrix` 22 and 24 and `linux-x86_64` all green. That commit contains every merge from this stretch: #543, #544, #545, #546, #549, #548 and #547. So `main` is confirmed healthy after all of them, not assumed.\n\nThat closes the v1.2.1 batch: WM-2 (edit-failure feedback), CX-5 (the compaction invariant), VC-5 (verified re-check on resume) and WM-4 (function-call text recovery), with the research record, the plan updates, and the stable-archive G1.1-4 evidence.\n\nStill open, none of it on `main`:\n- **Slice 2:** the agent is building it. I'll review its bwrap profile and run the probes myself.\n- **Slices 5 and 3:** queued behind Slice 2.\n- **Local hardening branches:** `hard1`, `hard4`, `hard6` and `hard7` are not pushed. They stay local per your ground rules, until you tell me to open PRs.\n\nNothing else is running. I'm waiting for the Slice 2 report."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":473,"cache_read_input_tokens":785728,"output_tokens":377,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":473,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":377,"cache_read_input_tokens":785728,"cache_creation_input_tokens":473,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":473},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Ch5GGCgTLcfTeHNYopc