{"parentUuid":"b6a5d355-61f7-4093-99a0-81e44d2e63dd","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch5TTDh5D4ac3Zq7PaGtr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"My own Slice 2 verification run is still going, and its output only appears when it finishes. Nothing to read yet. The sandbox tests are slow because each case runs a real bwrap process.\n\nStatus of the seven slices, all local and none pushed:\n- **Validated by me:** Slices 1, 4, 6 and 7.\n- **Slice 2:** the fix is probe-verified on all three workspace layouts, and the core test files are still running on both Node versions. The agent reports 200 of 200 on Node 22. On Node 24, 21 eval-dataset tests fail on this host and fail identically on its base, which I'll confirm against CI later.\n- **Slice 3 (docs):** committed and reviewed. Its Docker section waits on Slice 5.\n- **Slice 5 (Docker):** the agent is implementing it.\n\nI'll open the PRs only after Slice 5 is validated and the docs are reconciled to its final code."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":487,"cache_read_input_tokens":825909,"output_tokens":398,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":93},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":487,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":398,"cache_read_input_tokens":825909,"cache_creation_input_tokens":487,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":487},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Ch5TTDPTtnKGchSyjCZu5","requestRef":"8cd65ea8-c9b8-454e-9eac-041a4f38ad36","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","promptCacheRequest