adable in a real container.\n\nBefore the fix, 4 of the 5 failed on `a674f152`. The `HOME/proj` case passed before and after, as you described.\n\n**Results:**\n\n| Run | Total | Pass | Fail |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `sandbox_docker`, `sandbox_confine`, `sandbox_quoting`, `command_env`, Node 22 | 31 | 31 | 0 |\n| Same four files, Node 24 | 31 | 31 | 0 |\n\n`npm --prefix cli run build` is clean.\n\n**CHANGELOG proposal:** extend the earlier entry with this sentence: \"When the workspace is `$HOME` or an ancestor of it, credential directories and files under `$HOME` (`.ssh`, `.config/nexus`, `.netrc`, and similar) are masked inside the container as well.\"</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>103038</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>5</tool_uses><duration_ms>114432</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"6473a60e-9fa2-4bd9-9d0c-35324295cf68","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/mike/nexus-code","sessionId":"6473a60e-9fa2-4bd9-9d0c-35324295cf68","version":"2.1.323","gitBranch":"main","slug":"robust-rolling-otter"}
