{"parentUuid":"54707a86-aee0-4252-82bc-acf10fa115ad","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch5fFXcQNvWfv3Q8CFCgt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I stopped the seven stale waiters. The live watch is `bwot2r7c8`, on the `main` CI runs for `bbde9319` and `56b47551`.\n\n**Where things stand, since Claude Code won't wake this session until you write**\n\nDone and merged, each at its exact head after verification:\n- **v1.2.1 units:** CX-5, VC-5, WM-2 and WM-4, plus the research record, the plan updates and the stable-archive G1.1-4 evidence. `main` was confirmed green on the final commit `011bb6b3`.\n- **All seven hardening slices:**\n\n  | Slice | PR | Merge commit |\n  |---|---|---|\n  | 4 | #551 | `b42ae2d6` |\n  | 1 | #550 | `2639213d` |\n  | 6 | #552 | `21487c97` |\n  | 7 | #553 | `57d10ccb` |\n  | 2 | #554 | `b9a89f2b` |\n  | 5 | #555 | `bbde9319` |\n  | 3, docs | #556 | `56b47551` |\n\n**Not confirmed yet:** `main` is not confirmed healthy after the hardening merges. Its CI run on `bbde9319` (the last commit containing all six code slices) is still in progress, and I cancelled four intermediate runs to free the shared runners, all logged and re-runnable. If that run fails, I'd re-run the intermediates to isolate the slice. The watch will report the result in this session, but it won't wake me, so look at the `main` run on `bbde9319` if you'd like to confirm before I do.\n\n**Known limits, in the docs now on `main`:**\n- Without `--sandbox`, a command runs as your user, so it can still read your files and its parents' `/proc/<pid>/environ`. The environment scrub removes only what a command inherits.\n- Under `--sandbox`, files outside `$HOME` are still readable.\n- G1.1-4 remains unmet on v1.2.0 (195/200 on rc.1, 155/200 on the published archive), and I make no frontier-grade claim.\n\n**Two things I'd suggest next, neither started:** a measured G1.1-4 on a v1.2.1 release candidate containing the WM-4 fix, and a follow-up on the unguarded `git diff` in `evaluator.ts`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4492,"cache_read_input_tokens":947269,"output_tokens":769,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4492,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":769,"cache_read_input_tokens":947269,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4492,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4492},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Ch5fFXKnPxkm7fdP8gcHP","requestRef":"07dd8af4-f57e-410c-8917-dc4a997be4b5","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"716690e7-1a54-4f4b-ba9c-92c06eb333af","timestamp":"2026-11-16T00:28:24.717Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6473a60e-9fa2-4bd9-9d0c-35324295cf68","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/mike/nexus-code","sessionId":"6473a60e-9fa2-4bd9-9d0c-35324295cf68","version":"2.1.323","gitBranch":"main","slug":"robust-rolling-otter"}
