{"parentUuid":"7a6ab07c-ed44-46b3-b2a0-a78d5b68144e","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01GkLnzrBj7AxfbBfjj4BFwA","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"72d79ecc-8a94-4cd3-a082-749650cd1dc4","timestamp":"2026-11-16T00:45:34.593Z","session_id":"6473a60e-9fa2-4bd9-9d0c-35324295cf68","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/mike/nexus-code","sessionId":"6473a60e-9fa2-4bd9-9d0c-35324295cf68","version":"2.1.323","gitBranch":"main","slug":"robust-rolling-otter"}
{"parentUuid":"72d79ecc-8a94-4cd3-a082-749650cd1dc4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch5gZR3sTH5sNCEQtNiMA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"`main` is confirmed healthy at its final commit `56b47551`: the CI run completed with success on `test-matrix` 22 and 24 and `linux-x86_64`. All seven hardening merge commits are ancestors of it (Slices 4, 1, 6, 7, 2, 5 and the docs), so that run tested the whole set together, not just the docs. The `bbde9319` run is still going, but it is a strict subset of what `56b47551` already passed, so it can't change that conclusion.\n\nThat closes the hardening task as you specified.\n\n| Slice | PR | Result |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1: environment scrub | #550 | merged, `2639213d` |\n| 2: write-mode sandbox | #554 | merged, `b9a89f2b` |\n| 3: docs match the code | #556 | merged, `56b47551` |\n| 4: worktree merge guard | #551 | merged, `b42ae2d6`; the vulnerability reproduced and the fix's tests fail on unfixed `main` |\n| 5: Docker sandbox | #555 | merged, `bbde9319`; digest verified against the registry |\n| 6: protected paths | #552 | merged, `21487c97` |\n| 7: `allowExternalSymlinks` | #553 | merged, `57d10ccb` |\n\n**User-visible behaviour changes** (all in the changelog's `[Unreleased]` section on `main`): commands no longer inherit your credentials and need `NEXUS_COMMAND_ENV_PASSTHROUGH` to opt in; `--sandbox` masks `$HOME` and has no network unless you pass `--sandbox-network`; the legacy worktree merge no longer fires your own git hooks; the Docker sandbox runs a pinned image with no network by default; and workspaces under directories like `~/.env-tools/` are no longer blocked.\n\n**Left open, none of it started:**\n- **Known limit:** without `--sandbox`, a command still runs as your user. It can read your files and its parents' `/proc/<pid>/environ`.\n- **Follow-ups:** `evaluator.ts` still runs `git diff` in the evaluator workspace unguarded (low risk, unverified), and routing the legacy merge through the `worktrunk` implementation wasn't done.\n- **G1.1-4 on v1.2.0:** still unmet (195/200, then 155/200). A measurement on a v1.2.1 release candidate containing the WM-4 fix is the next step."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":829,"cache_read_input_tokens":956130,"output_tokens":823,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":829,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":823,"cache_read_input_tokens":956130,"cache_creation_input_tokens":829,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":829},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Ch5gZQiXYnjWY1jZmVK2t","requestRef":"34489cf5-4004-411b-8f0c-327ca4f10a16","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"ebcc068b-f29f-441d-a671-ae7ce53d810c","timestamp":"2026-11-16T00:45:34.574Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6473a60e-9fa2-4bd9-9d0c-35324295cf68","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/mike/nexus-code","sessionId":"6473a60e-9fa2-4bd9-9d0c-35324295cf68","version":"2.1.323","gitBranch":"main","slug":"robust-rolling-otter"}
