{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"6473a60e-9fa2-4bd9-9d0c-35324295cf68","id":"3e16b577-a716-4414-b742-20b2836d0dc5","timestamp":"2026-11-16T01:56:05.104Z","version":"2.1.323","querySource":"repl_main_thread","shapeHash":"02245c82d4cb86350db44b7c9960d5f359fa3c3746ce766c103fc6f328b1a703","params":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"medium"}},"base":"0911a326-ed40-45f4-8ae1-80f0d1c3d8d7","keep":91,"tail":["c05aca086174f51418b3639aa09d745056a02da8d6ab712d7f169a98404a0b0b","2511fd81a3658bcf1f7fd39c04cfee163140132e500b2aea180b19333cefe753","3bad71dc3ffc775ae082591b64158248819f867b7d394ad69feea31c98514778"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",93,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"88bdfeb984376c7b380f373b15e5f62364895327eafb27476618b84ca01e7be6"}
