{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"6473a60e-9fa2-4bd9-9d0c-35324295cf68","hash":"73328968331e6915093ae5eaebdb9d7185b7b21678fdb0e6540c77a3783a8f63","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"While those run, I'm checking `commander` 12→15, which crosses three majors. CI passing isn't enough for that, so I want the actual breaking changes and how the CLI uses the library."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01HyKgKbKjnc9fzuyTk7UFBk","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/mike/nexus-code && for v in v13.0.0 v14.0.0 v15.0.0; do echo \"=== commander $v\"; gh api repos/tj/commander.js/releases/tags/$v -q .body 2>/dev/null | head -40; done; echo; echo \"node engines of commander 15:\"; npm view commander@15.1.0 engines 2>/dev/null","description":"Fetch commander release notes for majors 13, 14 and 15 and its engines requirement"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01M52LH68g3CmjB7WV6sAvCS","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/mike/nexus-code && grep -rn \"from \\\"commander\\\"\\|from 'commander'\\|require(\\\"commander\\\")\" cli/src | head; echo ---; grep -rnE \"\\.(passThroughOptions|enablePositionalOptions|allowExcessArguments|allowUnknownOption|exitOverride|configureOutput|storeOptionsAsProperties|combineFlagAndOptionalValue|opts\\(\\)|optsWithGlobals|addHelpCommand|helpOption|showHelpAfterError|showSuggestionAfterError|parseAsync|argParser|hook\\()\" cli/src | wc -l; grep -n '\"node\"' cli/package.json","description":"Find how the CLI imports and uses commander features that changed across majors"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
