{"parentUuid":"0d774376-9c17-4253-a869-88f70e2cb349","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch5qMGJjSVLPdxuK2S8eE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Progress on the Dependabot PRs so far:\n\n- **#533 (`dotenv` 18.0.9→18.0.10):** merged as `83be4d47`. Rebased, all eight checks passing on a merge with the current `main`, and a diff of just the pin and lockfile.\n- **#530 (`commander` 12→15):** Dependabot never rebased it, so I'm doing it on our own branch, `v1/deps-commander-15`.\n  - Typecheck and build are clean, and the CLI reports its version through commander 15.\n  - I raised `engines` to `>=22.12.0` in both `package.json` and the lockfile root, because commander 15 requires it.\n  - The full CLI suite is running now with a throwaway HOME. This host has no built Rust core, so some tests fail here for that reason and CI is the arbiter. I'll compare the failing set against `main`'s, not read the raw total.\n  - After that I open a PR, merge on a green CI at its exact head, and close #530 as superseded with a link.\n- **Experiments bumps:** I asked Dependabot to rebase #528, #529, #532 and #537, the four `vite` 8.3.6→8.3.8 PRs. I'll request the `cf` and `@cloudflare/vite-plugin` groups next, a few at a time, so CI isn't flooded.\n\nNothing else is merged or closed yet."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":673,"cache_read_input_tokens":153736,"output_tokens":456,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":673,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":456,"cache_read_input_tokens":153736,"cache_creation_input_tokens":673,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6