ote outside the workspace and `/tmp`, relied on root, or used the network now fail in Docker mode."," ","+### Changed","+","+- The CLI parser moved to commander 15 (from 12), which is ESM-only and needs Node.js 22.12.0 or newer; `engines.node` is now `>=22.12.0` (it was `>=22`). Commander 13 also makes extra positional arguments an error (\"too many arguments\") instead of ignoring them; no `nexus` command accepted them meaningfully.","+"," ### Fixed"," "," - Protected-path matching is relative to the workspace root, so projects under directories such as `~/.env-tools/` are no longer blocked wholesale; symlinks to protected targets are still refused."]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false,"contentNotInModelContext":true},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"2f942b5f-43e4-4771-b181-0b4c7c040c0f","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"6473a60e-9fa2-4bd9-9d0c-35324295cf68","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/mike/nexus-code","sessionId":"6473a60e-9fa2-4bd9-9d0c-35324295cf68","version":"2.1.323","gitBranch":"main","slug":"robust-rolling-otter"}
