{"parentUuid":"6e84c8ab-6854-4fec-9e67-762eaaf74ed9","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"1df71b39-70bc-48d8-8601-54acd84aba87","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01C63MSh4pW6awBSDAzVFCi7","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /home/mike/nexus-wt/deps-commander/CHANGELOG.md has been updated successfully."}]},"uuid":"c8b52999-7cf1-44b3-80d6-91b265443cc1","timestamp":"2026-11-16T03:11:28.833Z","toolUseResult":{"filePath":"/home/mike/nexus-wt/deps-commander/CHANGELOG.md","oldString":"Commander 13 also makes extra positional arguments an error (\"too many arguments\") instead of ignoring them; no `nexus` command accepted them meaningfully.","newString":"Commander 13 made extra positional arguments an error; Nexus keeps ignoring them as before (`nexus doctor extra` still runs doctor), so command-line behaviour is unchanged.","originalFile":null,"structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":17,"oldLines":7,"newStart":17,"newLines":7,"lines":[" "," ### Changed"," ","-- The CLI parser moved to commander 15 (from 12), which is ESM-only and needs Node.js 22.12.0 or newer; `engines.node` is now `>=22.12.0` (it was `>=22`). Commander 13 also makes extra positional arguments an error (\"too many arguments\") instead of ignoring them; no `nexus` command accepted them meaningfully.","+- The CLI parser moved to commander 15 (from 12), which is ESM-only and needs Node.js 22.12.0 or newer; `engines.node` is now `>=22.12.0` (it was `>=22`). Commander 13 made extra positional arguments an error; Nexus keeps ignoring them as before (`nexus doctor extra` still runs doctor), so command-line behaviour is unchanged."," "," ### Fixed"," "]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false,"contentNotInModelContext":true},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"6e84c8ab-6854-4fec-9e67-762eaaf74ed9","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"6473a60e-9fa2-4bd9-9d0c-35324295cf68","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/mike/nexus-code","sessionId":"6473a60e-9fa2-4bd9-9d0c-35324295cf68","version":"2.1.323","gitBranch":"main","slug":"robust-rolling-otter"}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"6473a60e-9fa2-4bd9-9d0c-35324295cf68","hash":"52a9a5813e7d3b5c873082d9e32057a12ad794b47c9981146d27ad44e76c66e8","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Both sites need it, and in `index.ts` the setting is placed before any subcommand is created so they inherit it."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014dP7bp9QEnmSCz5SN5ZzbA","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/home/mike/nexus-wt/deps-commander/cli/src/index.ts","old_string":"program.enablePositionalOptions();\n","new_string":"program.enablePositionalOptions();\n\n// Commander 13 made extra positional arguments an error. Nexus has always ignored them (`nexus doctor extra` runs\n// doctor), and a dependency bump should not change the CLI contract, so keep that. Set before any subcommand is\n// created: subcommands copy this setting when they are added.\nprogram.allowExcessArguments(true);\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014RyFARZfnoBU1zLFsm7mDQ","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/home/mike/nexus-wt/deps-commander/cli/src/sidecar.ts","old_string":"  const program = new Command()\n    .name(\"nexus-sidecar\")","new_string":"  const program = new Command()\n    .allowExcessArguments(true) // as the nexus CLI: commander 13+ would otherwise reject extra arguments the sidecar always ignored\n    .name(\"nexus-sidecar\")"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01C63MSh4pW6awBSDAzVFCi7","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/home/mike/nexus-wt/deps-commander/CHANGELOG.md","old_string":"Commander 13 also makes extra positional arguments an error (\"too many arguments\") instead of ignoring them; no `nexus` command accepted them meaningfully.","new_string":"Commander 13 made extra positional arguments an error; Nexus keeps ignoring them as before (`nexus doctor extra` still runs doctor), so command-line behaviour is unchanged."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
