{"parentUuid":"dec367f1-df04-4b5d-94ad-573fd6e2070a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch5sp8CJETUmqgvesaxBr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Cz7bDifjMfvtek7oz81DrF","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/mike/nexus-wt/deps-commander && git add CHANGELOG.md cli/package-lock.json cli/package.json cli/src/index.ts cli/src/sidecar.ts cli/test/cli_excess_arguments.test.ts && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nchore(deps): commander 12 -> 15, engines node >=22.12.0, keep ignoring extra arguments\n\nSupersedes the Dependabot bump (#530), which could not be rebased and left engines at >=22\nwhile commander 15 requires Node 22.12.0. Commander 13 made extra positional arguments an\nerror; `nexus doctor extra` and `nexus trust a b` were silently accepted before, so\nallowExcessArguments(true) keeps the CLI contract unchanged. New test fails 2/2 without it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit push -q -u origin v1/deps-commander-15 2>&1 | tail -1; git log --oneline -1 | cut -c1-90; git rev-parse --short=8 HEAD","description":"Commit the commander 15 change and push the branch"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":848,"cache_read_input_tokens":175299,"output_tokens":595,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":134},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":848,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":595,"cache_read_input_tokens":175299,"cache_creation_input_tokens":848,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":848},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management