{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"6473a60e-9fa2-4bd9-9d0c-35324295cf68","id":"14c114cf-1bc5-4b58-9edc-15e5a85d7935","timestamp":"2026-11-16T03:14:11.956Z","version":"2.1.323","querySource":"repl_main_thread","shapeHash":"02245c82d4cb86350db44b7c9960d5f359fa3c3746ce766c103fc6f328b1a703","params":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"medium"}},"base":"1d8ed27e-a4c7-4d9a-9ff8-f5042b5d91f1","keep":223,"tail":["55b68da4a7a74af0c7638cb1ed36cef6f4d1e7a316687b9268d7229ae2533776","9fd6a5c30ac6eaf0be80b9d36d21d1a260041bc2c744c9dfb81d6ddcbb9cbfb2","d04cc38be9eb2fb2deb58e608aa9f1ac52d1a7c059ebdd18120aff527224bfa1"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",225,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"f90488072f401b63ce025558b74552a4082d05bd965d52ad58bc51bb14096f69"}
{"parentUuid":"10726e63-b1d1-42c8-980c-05b11179552d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch5suAsRg2d1G8xCs9BMG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#557 (the `commander` 15 PR that replaces #530) is open, and I'm now waiting on CI for it and for the vite group.\n\n- **#557:** a local test run showed commander 15 changed one behaviour. On commander 12, `nexus doctor extra` ran doctor and `nexus trust a b` acted on `a`; on commander 15 both exit with \"too many arguments\". I kept the old behaviour with `allowExcessArguments(true)` on both the CLI and the sidecar, since a dependency bump shouldn't change the CLI's contract. I added a test that fails 2/2 without that line and passes 2/2 with it. I also raised `engines.node` to `>=22.12.0`, which commander 15 needs, in `package.json` and the lockfile.\n- **Local result:** the option-handling tests gave 126 pass and 4 fail. The same four fail on a clean `main` with commander 12, because this host has no built Rust core, so CI is the real check.\n- **Vite group:** #528 and #537 are rebased and in CI. #529 and #532 are still waiting on Dependabot.\n\nWatches `b4jh31cwv` (#557) and `bik5o341u` (the vite group) will report as each finishes. I merge each PR at its exact head only after its own checks pass, then close #530 as superseded, linking #557."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":740,"cache_read_input_tokens":178341,"output_tokens":439,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":740,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":439,"cache_read_input_tokens":178341,"cache_creation_input_tokens":740,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"epheme