{"parentUuid":"9e2f3ba8-3359-48df-8267-40f74b3ddc42","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch5vqGu4PSqjVkt6PbLUk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_011L6oFmxLjSvkybZbUDBUyK","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/mike/nexus-wt/deps-commander && git add CHANGELOG.md cli/package-lock.json cli/package.json && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nchore(deps): commander 14, not 15, to keep the Node.js 22 floor\n\nCI on #557 caught that raising engines to >=22.12.0 (needed by commander 15) breaks the\nnode_floor invariant: package engines, doctor, the upgrade preflight and install.sh all\nstate a major-only floor of 22, and the v1.0.0 spec text asserts it. Commander 14 supports\nNode >=20 and is maintainer-supported until May 2027, so the floor is untouched. Commander\n15 follows when the floor is raised deliberately (Node 22 reaches end of life in April 2027).\nallowExcessArguments(true) and its test are unchanged: commander 13+ rejects extra arguments.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit push -q origin v1/deps-commander-15 2>&1 | tail -1; git rev-parse --short=8 HEAD; git diff --stat origin/main...HEAD | cat","description":"Commit the switch to commander 14 and push"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":571,"cache_read_input_tokens":203603,"output_tokens":482,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":571,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":482,"cache_read_input_tokens":203603,"cache_creation_input_tokens":571,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":571},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","