{"parentUuid":"b01781b6-d16e-41cf-b78d-393089c4aafb","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch5xALZj38GcPWNcUWHuR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Four Dependabot PRs have now been merged:\n\n| PR | Change | Merge commit |\n|---|---|---|\n| #533 | `dotenv` 18.0.9→18.0.10 | `83be4d47` |\n| #537 | `vite` in `agent-collab-worker` | `49694eb6` |\n| #528 | `vite` in the vertical-slice root | `1fea8727` |\n| #535 | `cf` → beta.31 in the vertical-slice root | `f48507ed` |\n| #536 | `cf` beta.28 → beta.31 in `shared-ref-worker` | `46ca745e` |\n\nThat is five, counting #536. Each was merged at its exact head with every check passing. Every run tested a merge on top of `main`, and I read each diff. Dependabot re-resolved #535 and #536 to beta.31 when it rebased, and I confirmed that version exists on the registry before merging.\n\n**Still open:**\n- **#557 (`commander` 14):** CI is running on the new head.\n- **#527, #534, #529, #532:** waiting on Dependabot's rebase.\n- **#531, #538, #539, #540:** I've just requested their rebases, the last group.\n- **#530 (`commander` 15):** closes as superseded once #557 merges.\n\nThe watch (`ba0qb7qfl`) covers #557. I'll check the rebased ones as they land, since several have failures from their stale base that I expect to clear."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":377,"cache_read_input_tokens":211531,"output_tokens":475,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":377,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":475,"cache_read_input_tokens":211531,"cache_creation_input_tokens":377,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":377},"typ