{"parentUuid":"8ac24a29-6172-4db2-8b70-1e7fcd9b587e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch5xHYaxzcvmhRnXxhC9R","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#531 is not merged. I made a mistake on it: I told you the merge had happened and logged it, before I'd checked the result.\n\n- **Why it wasn't merged:** Dependabot force-pushed #531 to a new head (`6aa8f961`) after I had verified `2a9c3c72`. My head-match guard refused to merge the unverified commit, which is the guard doing its job. The new head is rebased onto the latest `main` and its checks are pending.\n- **My error:** I hid the merge command's output, so I missed the refusal. I logged \"merged #531\" and requested a rebase of #538 as if it had landed. I've appended a correction to the claims log. I'll stop suppressing merge output so a refusal shows up.\n- **#538:** Dependabot has also rebased it (`a32eef64`). It shares `agent-collab-worker/package.json` with #531, so I merge #531 first and then check that #538 still passes on top.\n\n**Dependabot status:**\n- **Merged:** #533, #537, #528, #535 and #536, five in all.\n- **In CI:** #557 (`commander` 14), #531 and #538.\n- **Waiting on Dependabot to rebase:** #527, #534, #529, #532, #539 and #540.\n- **Superseded:** #530 closes once #557 merges.\n\nOne watch (`bawx4am09`) covers #557, #531 and #538. I check each at its exact head before merging."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1947,"cache_read_input_tokens":217018,"output_tokens":466,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1947,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":466,"cache_read_input_tokens":217018,"cache_creation_input_tokens":