{"parentUuid":"3f44ac32-ad6c-4611-a789-797e225d1248","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch5zFxc2W4hLe4WLfn7Ka","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#557 is merged and #530 is closed.\n\n**Merged this session:**\n\n| PR | Change | Merge commit |\n|---|---|---|\n| #533 | `dotenv` 18.0.9 → 18.0.10 | `83be4d47` |\n| #537 | `vite` in `agent-collab-worker` | `49694eb6` |\n| #528 | `vite` in the vertical-slice root | `1fea8727` |\n| #535 | `cf` → beta.31, vertical-slice root | `f48507ed` |\n| #536 | `cf` → beta.31, `shared-ref-worker` | `46ca745e` |\n| #557 | `commander` 12 → **14** (replaces #530) | `3320a76a` |\n\n- **#557 result:** on Node 22 it ran 3,892 tests with 0 failures. This run included `node_floor`, which caught the problem in the first version, and my new excess-argument test, which pins the extra-argument behaviour.\n- **#530:** closed by Dependabot's ignore (it closes the PR itself) after my explanation. The ignore covers only commander's 15.x major, so it can't reopen, and `@dependabot unignore` reverses it. I'll revisit commander 15 when Node 22 reaches end of life around April 2027 and the floor is raised on purpose.\n\n**Still open (7):**\n- **In CI after a rebase onto `main`:** #531, #538, #539, #540 and #532.\n- **Stale and not yet rebased (70 behind):** #527, #534 and #529. I'll use `@dependabot recreate` on these if they don't move.\n- **Ordering:** #531 merges before #538, since they share a file.\n\n**Not yet confirmed:** `main` CI on `3320a76a`. The watch (`blqcztb0x`) reports that along with the four PRs in flight. I won't call `main` healthy until I've read its conclusion."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1768,"cache_read_input_tokens":224777,"output_tokens":627,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests