{"parentUuid":"4bffcf8d-9f69-40a8-868b-a7e3fcf3174d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch64YwsZA2imDQzQYUQcM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Eleven of the fourteen Dependabot PRs are merged, with every merge verified from the PR's final state.\n\n- **Merged:**\n  - **`dotenv`:** #533.\n  - **`vite`:** #537 and #528.\n  - **`cf`:** #535, #536 and #534.\n  - **`@cloudflare/vite-plugin`:** #531, #539 and #540.\n  - **`cf`, combined with #531 on `agent-collab-worker`:** #538. Its green run was tested on top of #531, so the combined pins were exercised together.\n  - **`commander`:** #557, as 14 in place of 15, with #530 closed and its 15.x major ignored (reversible with `@dependabot unignore`).\n- **Left:**\n  - **#532 and #529 (`vite`):** in CI. #529 shares a file with #534, so I'll confirm its tested base includes #534 before merging.\n  - **#527 (`cf`):** I've just asked Dependabot to rebase it, since it is 80 commits behind.\n- **`main` health:** the run on `3320a76a` (commander 14) is green. The final run on `1366ed42` and the later merge commits are still to come, so I won't call `main` fully confirmed until the last one concludes.\n\nThe watch (`b2en131t3`) is still live for #532, #529 and `main`. I'll add #527 when its rebase lands."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1013,"cache_read_input_tokens":249023,"output_tokens":458,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1013,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":458,"cache_read_input_tokens":249023,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1013,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1013},"type":"message"}]