{"parentUuid":"88d7843c-ec0a-466b-9fb1-5d00ed89726c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch67BwncfQ9ohE2WB3ocA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The Dependabot queue is down to two PRs, and one of them needed a stronger request.\n\n- **#529 (`vite`, `fork-worker`):** one job left in CI, running on top of #534. I merge it at its exact head once it's green and confirmed tested on the current base.\n- **#527 (`cf`, trusted-broker-bundle):** my rebase request got no response in over an hour and it is now 82 commits behind. I've asked Dependabot to recreate it instead, which rebuilds the branch from the current `main`. Once it reappears with fresh checks, it goes through the same verification before merging.\n\n**Merged:** twelve of fourteen so far.\n\n**`main`:** the run on `1366ed42` is green. The runs on `0309952d` and the newest `efdde611` (#532) are still going. I won't call `main` fully confirmed until the last one concludes.\n\nThe watch (`btbd962lc`) covers #529, #527 and those two `main` runs."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1479,"cache_read_input_tokens":257176,"output_tokens":315,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1479,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":315,"cache_read_input_tokens":257176,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1479,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1479},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Ch67BwZiHA86RERCxELhb","requestRef":"baa6cdb1-c133-46ef-a40a-e4f1e26ab562","requestedModel":"