{"parentUuid":"03bad13c-ccdb-45de-85b8-d2398c74596b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch69FpF32KX3LmgdhLmjj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Thirteen of the fourteen Dependabot PRs are merged, and `main` is green at every commit I've read a conclusion for. The last PR, #527, has been recreated and is in CI.\n\nEach merge was made at the PR's exact head after its checks passed. I read each diff, and I confirmed the tested base contained any earlier merge that touched the same file.\n\n**`main` CI conclusions so far:** `3320a76a` (commander 14), `1366ed42`, `0309952d` and `efdde611` (#532) all completed with success on `linux-x86_64`, `test-matrix (22)` and `test-matrix (24)`. The run on `8854e9f0` (#529) is the newest and still going.\n\n**Remaining:**\n- **#527 (`cf`, trusted-broker-bundle):** Dependabot recreated it after my rebase request went unanswered, and its checks are in progress. It gets the same verification, then a merge.\n- **`main` confirmation:** the `8854e9f0` run decides whether the last merge left `main` healthy.\n\nThe watch (`bt4kr83qj`) covers both and reports when each finishes."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":906,"cache_read_input_tokens":262957,"output_tokens":372,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":906,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":372,"cache_read_input_tokens":262957,"cache_creation_input_tokens":906,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":906},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestI