{"parentUuid":"e1b81ee8-dc0e-4124-a01e-7cc9a67c73f9","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01JaeQzYqQ2n3J4dTZR5qdqv","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"367b1832-202c-489d-950c-d3572747943d","timestamp":"2026-11-16T06:50:33.957Z","session_id":"6473a60e-9fa2-4bd9-9d0c-35324295cf68","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/mike/nexus-code","sessionId":"6473a60e-9fa2-4bd9-9d0c-35324295cf68","version":"2.1.323","gitBranch":"main","slug":"robust-rolling-otter"}
{"parentUuid":"367b1832-202c-489d-950c-d3572747943d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch6APYxc7UPZK5EU6YcDg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All 14 Dependabot PRs are actioned and none is still open. Thirteen are merged, and #530 is closed as superseded. `main` is at `e9ef4721`.\n\n| PR | Change | Result |\n|---|---|---|\n| #533 | `dotenv` 18.0.9 → 18.0.10 | merged |\n| #537, #528, #529, #532 | `vite` 8.3.6 → 8.3.8, in four directories | merged |\n| #535, #536, #534, #538, #527 | `cf` → beta.31, in five directories | merged |\n| #531, #539, #540 | `@cloudflare/vite-plugin` → beta.v.16, in three directories | merged |\n| #530 → #557 | `commander` 12 → **14** | #557 merged; #530 closed |\n\n**How they were verified:**\n- **Exact head:** each merge was made at the PR's exact head, after every check passed.\n- **Fresh base:** each had been tested on a current base. Several were rebased, and #527 was recreated, because their original runs were 57 or more commits stale.\n- **Shared files:** PRs that shared a file with an earlier merge (#538, #534, #529) were re-tested on top of it.\n- **Diffs read:** I read each diff.\n\n**Commander:**\n- **Why 14 instead of 15:** CI on the first version caught that raising `engines` to `>=22.12.0` broke the repo's Node-floor invariant, which `install.sh`, `doctor`, the upgrade preflight and a test all enforce as major-only. Commander 14 supports Node ≥20 and keeps the floor at 22.\n- **Behaviour kept:** commander 13 and later reject extra command-line arguments, where `nexus doctor extra` used to run doctor. I kept the old behaviour with `allowExcessArguments(true)` and a test that fails 2 of 2 without it.\n- **Ignore:** I asked Dependabot to ignore commander's 15.x major. `@dependabot unignore` reverses it, and the natural time to revisit is when Node 22 reaches end of life, around April 2027.\n\n**Mistakes of mine:** I told you #531 was merged when it wasn't, because Dependabot force-pushed a new head and my head-match guard correctly refused the merge. I had hidden the command's output and missed that. I corrected the claims log, and I now check the PR's final state before logging or reporting a merge. I also said Node 22.0–22.11 users would get a broken install on commander 15, which I hadn't verified and which is probably wrong for an ESM import.\n\n**`main` CI:** it was green on `3320a76a` (commander 14), `1366ed42`, `0309952d` and `efdde611`. The newest runs, on `8854e9f0` and the final `e9ef4721`, are still in progress, so I won't call `main` fully confirmed until they conclude. The watch (`br0q4do5j`) reports both. I cancelled five redundant intermediate `main` runs along the way, all logged and re-runnable.\n\n**Cleanup left:** my two helper worktrees (`deps-commander`, `deps-baseline`) are still on disk. I'll remove them once the final run is read."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1528,"cache_read_input_tokens":266287,"output_tokens":1055,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1528,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1055,"cache_read_input_tokens":266287,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1528,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1528},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Ch6APYfk4T5NqcD5xWAz5","requestRef":"25a24634-a805-45aa-8702-3bbfcc50369a","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"f272b2e0-6ae1-4da5-afb7-29a635d31b0e","timestamp":"2026-11-16T06:50:33.952Z","advisorModel":"c